04` — Verifies that confirming a shipment with unknown ID returns 404 Not Found with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND error code\n\nVerification\n  Command: ./mvnw test from /private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-c0b6721e-e1fe-4387-9e2b-bbd46bb420de/sample-service\n  Result: BUILD SUCCESS, Tests run: 17, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0\n\nNot done\n  None — All acceptance criteria met: existing build passes, existing tests pass, new endpoint confirms created shipments and persists changes, error responses are consistent with existing API patterns, retry behavior is idempotent, cancelled shipments are refused with 409, unknown IDs are refused with 404, no new Maven dependencies were added, and no unrelated production files were changed.\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1325,"cache_read_input_tokens":33603,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1325,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01AdKxUCfHQ3Xy4sBZSSYAJR","session_id":"0246e8dc-1db7-4cfc-89f2-95e54d536341","uuid":"eda1c25c-7143-4dc2-a1e1-85551cd5d628","timestamp":"2026-09-06T08:51:03.903Z","request_id":"req_011Cemu9P39znqbBkPEm5WcK","subagent_type":"implementer","task_description":"Implement BE-003 shipment confirm endpoint"}
